 \subsection{Complete E1 Results and Controls}
 E1 TPOT in seconds is 13.04259 (streaming), 21.75165 (SwapMoE-style), 8.25899 (Fiddler-style), 7.19497 (FlashMoE-RF), 7.78096 (MECC I/O), 7.38198 (MECC), and 32.94189 (independent). Streaming/MECC TTFT is 156.85501/139.14026 seconds; Fiddler-style TTFT is 398.446. Unrounded ratios give 4.46247$\times$ independent/MECC decode and 2.86363$\times$ Fiddler/MECC TTFT. FlashMoE-RF gives 1.81$\times$/1.54$\times$ decode/first-token speedup over streaming; MECC gives 1.77$\times$/1.13$\times$.
